, so that no path into the transmit arbiter exceeds about 20 levels.\n   - Prefer moving existing registers over adding latency.\n   - Where a cycle is added, grade it in `tb/pp_top` and `tb/aecp_notify` with planted mutants, and show no protocol-visible timing changes beyond what the suites accept.\n   - No port, register-map or parameter change; STOP if one is needed.\n3. **Before any RTL edit,** run `git grep -F` for every changed line across `tb/**/*.patch` and the exact-text mutant tables. Show every arm still plants.\n4. **Area.** Report the OOC 1x1 delta, own logic. STOP above 60 LUT or 120 FF.\n5. **Timing evidence.** Report the OOC timing summary before and after, worst five paths into the arbiter. The parent three-directive sweep runs at the pin adoption, not here.\n\n**Gates:**\n- every processor suite and campaign;\n- `make check`, Yosys and lint;\n- the parent consumer set of 17 at parent dev `28f9666f`, with the 148 and 22 patches.\n\nOutput: HANDOFF.md and PR-BODY.md (\"Closes #163\" if met). Then post REVIEW READY with the head on #163. Do not push.\n\nDo not edit or delete any existing comment.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6015580618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/comments/6015592098","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/163#issuecomment-6015592098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/163","id":6015592098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABZo6mog","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1615793